  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace-building with the communities of southern Tolima</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Department of Tolima has been an epicenter of the conflict in Colombia. Indigenous and rural communities there have long suffered the effects of the violence and struggle to maintain viable livelihoods. Corporacin Grupo Semillas (Semillas) is working with 15 grassroots organizations to implement sustainable agricultural practices ensure access to land and water and use communications tools such as community radio to increase the visibility of grassroots resilience and peacebuilding strategies. The IAF supports community-led solutions to enhance peace and security in Colombia. Semillas&apos;s activities bolster community-led efforts to counteract environmental degradation and protect the natural resources that these communities depend on. This grant is part of our broader initiative to build a just and lasting peace in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
